UID:10000904-1803977100-1804000500@ncbg.unc.edu
SUMMARY:School’s Out Camp: Forest Adventures 🌲
DESCRIPTION:Step into the magical world of the forest! This camp combines storytelling and nature exploration. Campers will learn about the plants and trees of the forest while hearing stories and folktales that feature forest creatures. Come ready to explore\, imagine\, and play! \nDesigned for young nature enthusiasts and led by our experienced educators\, our School’s Out Camps offer the perfect blend of outdoor exploration\, wildlife discovery\, and creative activities in a small-group setting. Kids enjoy a mix of indoor and outdoor learning experiences and loads of fun. \nDrop-off: 8:45-9:00 AM\, Pickup: 3:00-3:15 PM \nExtend the day with optional aftercare from 3–5 PM for additional fee ($20) \nChild-to-staff ratio of 1:7. \nCampers bring their own snack\, water bottle\, and lunch. \nFor grades 1-3 \nSpace is limited\, so reserve your child’s spot today! \nRegister here!
URL:https://ncbg.unc.edu/event/schools-out-camp-forest-adventures-%f0%9f%8c%b2/
LOCATION:North Carolina Botanical Garden\, 100 Old Mason Farm Road\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27517\, United States
CATEGORIES:Special Events
